{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>These.</b> Those mentioned above." "<b>These are the generations of the heavens and the earth when they were created, on the day that YHWH made.</b> It teaches you that all of them were created on the first [day]. Another matter: בְּהִבָּרְאָם — בְּה' בְרָאָם, as it says, ״בִּיָּהּ יְהֹוָה צוּר עוֹלָמִים״ (Isaiah 26) — with these letters of the Name He formed two worlds, and it teaches you here that this world was created with a הֵ' — a hint that they descended below to see destruction, like this הֵ' which is closed on all sides and open below to descend by way there."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:19.649866390Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}